        "La(NO3)3·nH2O",
        "Tm(NO3)3·5H2O"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "Raw precursors were added to an Erlenmeyer flask, ethanol was added, and reacted for 3 hours to obtain polymer solutions.",
        "Solutions were placed in an oven at 120°C for 10 hours, then calcined at 900°C for 2 hours in a muffle furnace to form precursor powders.",
        "Powders were mixed with 2 wt% polyvinyl alcohol (PVA) as an organic binder (weight ratio PVA:powders = 1:120) and formed into disks (20 mm diameter) under 20 MPa pressure with a retention time of 150 seconds.",
        "Disks were embedded in alumina and sintered at 1300°C for 4 hours in air using a heating rate of 5°C/min."
      ],
